{"records":[{"timestamp_text":"2026-01-12","participants":["TX-1","ACC-200"],"summary":"A message-export index references transaction TX-1 and states that the export was collected on 2026-01-12; it expressly notes that collection time is not incident time. The index adds no participant and does not establish who controlled ACC-200.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-message-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/message-export/message-77"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Alice Chen","ACC-100","ACC-200"],"summary":"An investigator memo repeats that Alice Chen is reported as the holder of ACC-100 and recommends obtaining provider-side account and authentication records. It states that the current packet is insufficient to verify ownership of destination account ACC-200.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-memo-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/memo/paragraph-2"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["ACC-200"],"summary":"A provider-request log records an unanswered request for account-holder information associated with ACC-200, sent after transaction review began. No response, account-holder name, or controller identifier is present in the packet, leaving the destination account relationship unresolved.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-support-001","source_locator":"case-a-scale/provider-request/request-200"}]}]}